0.9 21oct2026
* verify the server host key (known_hosts), reject unknown/changed keys
* optional trust-on-first-use with accept_new_host_key
* support Ed25519/ECDSA keys, not only RSA
* read password and key passphrase from environment variables
  (password_env, private_key_pass_env)
* warn if paramiko < 3.4.0 (Terrapin, CVE-2023-48795)
* connect/banner/auth/channel timeouts (option timeout)
* store upload state as JSON instead of pickle, written atomically
* do not advance the upload state after a failed connection, retry failed
  files on the next run
* do not follow symlinks outside of HTML_ROOT
* abort instead of retrying every file when the connection is lost
* skip VCS directories by name, use POSIX paths for the remote side

0.8 18oct2026
* update readme
* replace pysftp with paramiko
* replace cPickle with pickle

0.7 10may2020
* use binary mode for cPickle to ensure python3 compatibility

0.6 12mar2020
* parameterize command-line args for easier direct testing
* added support for private key and private key password

0.5 24apr2019
* update readme
* default to port 22 instead of 2222

0.4 08oct2018
* fixed typo in the log info

0.3 16sep2018
* fixed python module path bug in default skin.conf

0.2 08jul2018
* install a skin.conf file too, not just the generator
* install default values in the weewx config file to make installation easier

0.1 03mar2018
* initial release
